":"Answer","text":"When Polymarket and Kalshi have different prices for the same event, you buy YES on the cheaper platform and NO on the other. If the combined cost is less than $1, the difference is your profit regardless of outcome."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much can I make from prediction markets arbitrage?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"ArbBets finds 100+ arbitrage opportunities daily. Most opportunities yield 1-8% profit per trade. Returns depend on your capital and how quickly you execute."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer a prediction markets API?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, our Premium plan includes full API access with real-time arbitrage data, Polymarket and Kalshi prices, and clean normalized data for building automated trading systems."}}]}</script><div class="w-full py-24 lg:py-36"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-6 max-w-7xl"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr,0.9fr] gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-start"><div class="text-center lg:text-left"><div class="space-y-3"><h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.4rem] font-mono font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] text-foreground/90"><span class="block">Arbitrage on autopilot.</span></h1><p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-muted-foreground/85 leading-relaxed font-medium max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0">All the tools you need to automate your arbitrage and delta-neutral strategies on perps and prediction markets.</p></div><div class="mt-10 space-y-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><img src="/images/assets/pm.jpeg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="w-5 h-5 rounded"/>Polymarket</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><img src="/images/assets/kalshi.jpeg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="w-5 h-5 rounded"/>Kalshi</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><img src="/images/assets/opinions.jpg" al