trage?</h2><p><strong>Prediction market arbitrage</strong> buys YES on one platform and NO on another when combined prices fall below $1.00 — locking profit regardless of outcome. ArbBets scans Polymarket, Kalshi, and Opinion for 100+ fee-adjusted opportunities daily.</p><ul><li><strong>Typical ROI:</strong> 1–8% per trade after Kalshi fees</li><li><strong>Markets monitored:</strong> 990+ matched pairs across politics, macro, and crypto</li><li><strong>No winner limits:</strong> peer-to-peer exchanges vs soft sportsbooks</li><li><strong>2026 data:</strong> ArbBets’ <a href="/reports/prediction-market-arbitrage-2026">Prediction Market Arbitrage Report 2026</a> measured a ~9.6% average arb rate across six Kalshi–Polymarket scans</li></ul><p><a href="/blog/prediction-markets-arbitrage-guide">Prediction market arbitrage guide →</a> · <a href="/guides/arbitrage-betting-finder">Arbitrage bet finder →</a> · <a href="/reports/prediction-market-arbitrage-2026">2026 arbitrage report →</a></p></div><div><h2>Polymarket Kalshi arbitrage finder</h2><p>Our <strong>Polymarket Kalshi arbitrage finder</strong> matches identical events across both venues, walks orderbook depth, and shows net ROI after fees — the highest-volume cross-market corridor in 2026.</p><ul><li><strong>Free preview:</strong> live spreads on the Polymarket–Kalshi page, no login required</li><li><strong>Full demo:</strong> explore the <a href="/cross-market-arbitrage-demo">Cross-Market Arbitrage Demo</a> with a real historical snapshot</li><li><strong>Pro scanner:</strong> all three platforms plus alerts and faster refresh</li><li><strong>API:</strong> build bots with the <a href="/arbitrage-api">arbitrage betting API</a></li></ul><p><a href="/polymarket-kalshi-arbitrage">Polymarket–Kalshi arbitrage finder →</a> · <a href="/cross-market-arbitrage-demo">Cross-Market Arbitrage Demo →</a> · <a href="/arbitrage-calculator">Kalshi arbitrage calculator →</a> · <a href="/docs">Arbitrage betting API docs →</a> · <a href=