hildren\":\"Pro scanner:\"}],\" all three platforms plus alerts and faster refresh\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"API:\"}],\" build bots with the \",[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{\"href\":\"/arbitrage-api\",\"children\":\"arbitrage betting API\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{\"href\":\"/polymarket-kalshi-arbitrage\",\"children\":\"Polymarket–Kalshi arbitrage finder →\"}],\" · \",[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{\"href\":\"/cross-market-arbitrage-demo\",\"children\":\"Cross-Market Arbitrage Demo →\"}],\" · \",[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{\"href\":\"/arbitrage-calculator\",\"children\":\"Kalshi arbitrage calculator →\"}],\" · \",[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{\"href\":\"/docs\",\"children\":\"Arbitrage betting API docs →\"}],\" · \",[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{\"href\":\"/pricing\",\"children\":\"Pricing →\"}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"faq\",\"className\":\"container py-12 sm:py-16 mb-6 sm:mb-12 px-4 sm:px-8 md:px-16 lg:px-32\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\",\"children\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"$L1d\",null,{\"type\":\"single\",\"collapsible\":true,\"className\":\"w-full AccordionRoot\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1e\",\"item-1\",{\"value\":\"item-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"What is prediction market arbitrage?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Prediction market arbitrage exploits price differences across platforms like Polymarket, Kalshi, and Opinion. When these markets disagree on the probability of an event, you can trade both sides to capture the spread.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L1e\",\"item-2\",{\"value\":\"item-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"How does Polymarket Kalshi arbitrage work?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"When Polymarket prices an event at 60% YES and Kalshi prices it at 45% YES, you buy YES on Kalshi ($0.45) and NO on Polymarket ($0.40). Total cost: $0.85. Payout: $1.00. That's a 17.6% ROI on the arbitrage trade.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L1e\",\"item-3\",{\"value\":\"item-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"What are Positive EV plays and how do I find them?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Positive expected value plays (+EV) occur when the true probability of an outcome is higher than what the odds imply. Our tools identify these opportunities across Polymarket, Kalshi, and Opinion by comparing implied probabilities with calculated fair values.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L1e\",\"item-4\",{\"value\":\"item-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"How many arbitrage opportunities do you find daily?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"We identify 100+ arbitrage opportunities daily across Polymarket, Kalshi, and Opinion. Results vary based on execution speed, liquidity, and timing. Past performance is not indicative of future results.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L1e\",\"item-5\",{\"value\":\"item-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"What kind of returns can I expect from arbitrage?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Spreads typically range from 2-5% per opportunity before fees and slippage. We detect 100+ of these daily. Results depend on execution speed, platform fees, and market conditions. Trading involves risk and you may lose money. Past performance is not indicative of future results. Do your own research.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L1e\",\"item-6\",{\"value\":\"item-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Do you provide an API for arbitrage data?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Yes, our Premium plan includes full API access with real-time arbitrage opportunities, Polymarket and Kalshi price feeds, and clean normalized data. You can use our API to build automated arbitrage trading agents and bots.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L1e\",\"item-7\",{\"value\":\"item-7\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Can I build automated trading bots with your API?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Yes. Our API provides real-time arbitrage data, price feeds, and opportunity alerts that you can use to build automated arbitrage trading agents. The API updates continuously to capture opportunities as they emerge.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L1e\",\"item-8\",{\"value\":\"item-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"How fast do arbitrage opportunities disappear?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Some windows last hours, others close in minutes. Speed matters — opportunities can disappear quickly. Our real-time scanning surfaces them the moment they appear, and API access lets you automate execution entirely.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L1e\",\"item-9\",{\"value\":\"item-9\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"What platforms do you support?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"We scan Polymarket, Kalshi, and Opinion for arbitrage opportunities. Our tools calculate exact stake sizes and expected returns for cross-platform trades.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L1e\",\"item-10\",{\"value\":\"item-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Can I cancel my subscription at any time?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Yes, you can cancel your subscription at any time. You retain full access to all features until your current billing cycle ends.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L1e\",\"item-11\",{\"value\":\"item-11\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Do you offer refunds?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"We do not offer refunds. You can cancel anytime — you keep full access through the end of your billing period. We recommend exploring our free tools first to make sure it's a good fit before purchasing.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium mt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mr-2 mb-2 sm:mb-0 text-sm sm:text-base\",\"children\":[\"Still have questions?\",\" \"]}],[\"$\",\"$L21\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{\"href\":\"/pricing\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"button\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none ring-offset-background bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 py-2 px-4 rounded-md\",\"children\":\"See Pricing Plans\"}]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full py-12 md:py-24 lg:py-32 bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-black\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container mx-auto grid items-center justify-center gap-6 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:gap-10\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4 text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tighter md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\",\"children\":\"Spot Arbitrage Plays.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-md mx-auto md:max-w-xl lg:max-w-2xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400